OL,3,GNEWSAEngineers transform 200-year-old
OL,4,AItalian nativity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 200-year-old nativity scene has been
OL,7,Fbrought to life thanks to the expertise
OL,8,Fof volunteer engineers and tech
OL,9,Fexperts.
OL,11,FThe Auckland Project's Neapolitan
OL,12,Fnativity, made up of 421 hand-crafted
OL,13,Ffigures dating back to the 18th
OL,14,FCentury, is on display for the first
OL,15,Ftime at the Auckland Tower in its new
OL,16,Fformat.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
