OL,3,GNEWSAEngineers transform 200-year-old
OL,4,AItalian nativity
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe regeneration charity put out a call
OL,7,Ffor people with a technical background
OL,8,Fto volunteer their time and creative
OL,9,Fdesigner Richard Hartnell said he found
OL,10,Fa "dream team" of retired and
OL,11,Fsemi-retired experts.
OL,13,F"With the calibre of the people that
OL,14,Fare involved, it's just been
OL,15,Fincredible," he said.
